      "content": "These symptoms, particularly increased thirst and frequent urination, are classic signs of how uncontrolled blood sugar affects the body rather than typical side effects of a supplement. Gluco-Balance may contain active ingredients that temporarily lower glucose, which can initially cause rapid fluid shifts leading to these specific symptoms. It is crucial to contact your healthcare provider immediately for testing and guidance to ensure your diabetes is being managed safely while on this new medication.",
