      "content": "i mean i'm a bit worried but i dont really have time to go to the doctor right now since work is crazy. do u think it's possible it's just because of the supplement and i just need to drink more electrolytes or something? i feel kinda lightheaded too but maybe i just didnt eat enough lunch.",
